<is-land on:visible><div id="comp-bU6f3pyVIBzhWlLblsnu0" class="TwoColumnArticle" data-component-type="TwoColumnArticle"><div class="columnArticleClass two-layout-bg-white" id="twoColumnArticleTheme"><div id="sectionHeadingForTwoColumnArticle"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Why Virtual PLC?</span></h2></div></div></div></div></div><div class="text-start container multitextblock two-column-article"><div class="m-t-xl two-column-article-content layout-1-to-1 two-layout-top-alignment"><div class="p-lg-r-lg"><div><p>The virtual PLC is your ticket to Software-defined automation. With these, you can continue to rely on familiar processes and tools while benefiting from IT mechanisms. As a hardware-independent controller, the virtual PLC is provided and deployed entirely via Industrial Edge. Just download the SIMATIC S7‑1500V as an Industrial Edge app, central manage it and deploy it to your application environment using Industrial Edge Runtime.</p></div></div><div><div><div><div class="mb-4"><div class="p-0 col-sm-12 m-auto ratio ratio-16x9"><disw-video videoid="6b5da086-d369-476b-a72e-da618eab9be5" locale="en-US" autoplay="false"></disw-video></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><template data-island><script type="module" src="/shared-assets/1f5459c4589ce8f899743c2f1031e839981f40d9/lib/helpers/esm/index.module.js"></script><disw-hydrate component="TwoColumnArticle" props-url="/props/bU6f3pyVIBzhWlLblsnu0-en-US.json" page-id="26wHVQebuElD8uXWJpvug2" container="comp-bU6f3pyVIBzhWlLblsnu0"></disw-hydrate></template></div></is-land></div><div id='xB7RuPfuyNykn0V8MY1ei' class='sitesThreeColTiles themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='three-col-tiles_3' data-ste-section-id='xB7RuPfuyNykn0V8MY1ei'>
