<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Get more flexibility" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Get more flexibility</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>The virtual PLC is hardware-independent. You can also adjust the number of instances used according to demand, so you only pay for the controllers you need.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Integrate seamlessly" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Integrate seamlessly</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>The virtual controller is completely compatible with TIA Portal, allowing you to build on projects that are already in the tool. Also, you can use OT solutions that you have previously employed in an IT environment.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Increase efficiency" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Increase efficiency</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>The virtual PLC is integrated into Industrial Edge, allowing you to centrally operate applications and automate process steps in a datacentric way. Thanks to IT mechanisms, you can even optimize entire workflows and costs.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='RfFsIkpRtvY6pDA2TTQuo' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_4' data-ste-section-id='RfFsIkpRtvY6pDA2TTQuo'><is-land on:visible><div id="comp-RfFsIkpRtvY6pDA2TTQuo" class="CardsContainer" data-component-type="CardsContainer"><section id="RfFsIkpRtvY6pDA2TTQuo" class="cards-defaultBackground" role="region" aria-labelledby="section-heading-RfFsIkpRtvY6pDA2TTQuo"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Featured capabilities</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container"><div class="row cards-container-row"><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Integrate with Industrial Edge" id="G_Integrate%20with%20Industrial%20Edge-0" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Integrate%20with%20Industrial%20Edge-0-title" aria-describedby="G_Integrate%20with%20Industrial%20Edge-0-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"><picture><source type="image/webp"/><picture><img src="https://images.sw.cdn.siemens.com/siemens-disw-assets/public/6R64q5RHEjbQQ8YX5UlglI/en-US/Icon-nahtlose-Integration-TIA-Portal.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;w=640&amp;h=360&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cedges&amp;q=60" srcSet="https://images.sw.cdn.siemens.com/siemens-disw-assets/public/6R64q5RHEjbQQ8YX5UlglI/en-US/Icon-nahtlose-Integration-TIA-Portal.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;w=320&amp;h=360&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cedges&amp;q=60 320w, https://images.sw.cdn.siemens.com/siemens-disw-assets/public/6R64q5RHEjbQQ8YX5UlglI/en-US/Icon-nahtlose-Integration-TIA-Portal.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;w=640&amp;h=360&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cedges&amp;q=60 640w" sizes="100vw" alt="Open laptop displaying data-centric charts on the screen" class="cardImgTop lazy" loading="lazy"/></picture></picture></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Integrate%20with%20Industrial%20Edge-0-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Integrate with Industrial Edge</h3><div id="G_Integrate%20with%20Industrial%20Edge-0-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>The virtual PLC is provided entirely via Industrial Edge. First, download SIMATIC S7-1500V as an Edge app from the Marketplace. Then, access it in Industrial Edge Management and deploy it in the application.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Merging IT and OT" id="G_Merging%20IT%20and%20OT-1" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Merging%20IT%20and%20OT-1-title" aria-describedby="G_Merging%20IT%20and%20OT-1-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"><picture><source type="image/webp"/><picture><img src="https://images.sw.cdn.siemens.com/siemens-disw-assets/public/6P4eaNhia5w7yYFiqXkBur/en-US/27f6ffb6-0042-4de0-8d9c-7f3753be9dd8%20-%20Virtual%20PLC%20-%20Integration%20in%20Industrial%20Edge.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;w=640&amp;h=360&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cedges&amp;q=60" srcSet="https://images.sw.cdn.siemens.com/siemens-disw-assets/public/6P4eaNhia5w7yYFiqXkBur/en-US/27f6ffb6-0042-4de0-8d9c-7f3753be9dd8%20-%20Virtual%20PLC%20-%20Integration%20in%20Industrial%20Edge.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;w=320&amp;h=360&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cedges&amp;q=60 320w, https://images.sw.cdn.siemens.com/siemens-disw-assets/public/6P4eaNhia5w7yYFiqXkBur/en-US/27f6ffb6-0042-4de0-8d9c-7f3753be9dd8%20-%20Virtual%20PLC%20-%20Integration%20in%20Industrial%20Edge.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;w=640&amp;h=360&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cedges&amp;q=60 640w" sizes="100vw" alt="Diagram showing merging OT and IT " class="cardImgTop lazy" loading="lazy"/></picture></picture></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Merging%20IT%20and%20OT-1-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Merging IT and OT</h3><div id="G_Merging%20IT%20and%20OT-1-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Quicky and easily adjust the software used or number of controllers to your current requirements. The advantage of digitalization of PLCs is being able to react to changing requirements seamlessly.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="React remotely" id="G_React%20remotely-2" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_React%20remotely-2-title" aria-describedby="G_React%20remotely-2-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"><picture><source type="image/webp"/><picture><img src="https://images.sw.cdn.siemens.com/siemens-disw-assets/public/2oz90S0cmrJX2BMZHNLyh8/en-US/Grafik-Use-Case.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;w=640&amp;h=360&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cedges&amp;q=60" srcSet="https://images.sw.cdn.siemens.com/siemens-disw-assets/public/2oz90S0cmrJX2BMZHNLyh8/en-US/Grafik-Use-Case.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;w=320&amp;h=360&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cedges&amp;q=60 320w, https://images.sw.cdn.siemens.com/siemens-disw-assets/public/2oz90S0cmrJX2BMZHNLyh8/en-US/Grafik-Use-Case.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;w=640&amp;h=360&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cedges&amp;q=60 640w" sizes="100vw" alt="Woman laying down on her couch responding to issues with her controller" class="cardImgTop lazy" loading="lazy"/></picture></picture></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_React%20remotely-2-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">React remotely</h3><div id="G_React%20remotely-2-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>You get a notification of a controller issue, but you are at home. With a classical PLC, you have to go on site. With the virtual PLC, you can easily get your plant running again from anywhere.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><template data-island><script type="module" src="/shared-assets/1f5459c4589ce8f899743c2f1031e839981f40d9/lib/helpers/esm/index.module.js"></script><disw-hydrate component="CardsContainer" props-url="/props/RfFsIkpRtvY6pDA2TTQuo-en-US.json" page-id="26wHVQebuElD8uXWJpvug2" container="comp-RfFsIkpRtvY6pDA2TTQuo"></disw-hydrate></template></div></is-land></div><div id='5s3gj8wjKXEzEhCtAOI3Dg' class='sitesArticleContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='article-container_5' data-ste-section-id='5s3gj8wjKXEzEhCtAOI3Dg'>
